WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.550
Private label used to mean weeks of emails.

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:11.750
With Amphora, your customer builds the product themselves, from your own range.

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:16.550
Every size and grade is drawn to true scale.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:23.750
They only see the packs your lines can actually fill.

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:30.950
Weights and fill update with every choice, always inside your limits.

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:40.550
Their artwork goes straight onto the real pack, with the closure they choose.

00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:47.750
Then the case: trays, cartons and film.

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:57.350
Amphora works out the pallet and the container load.

00:00:57.750 --> 00:01:06.950
Barcodes, lot codes and best before are checked before any proof.

00:01:07.350 --> 00:01:16.550
The full specification lands with your sales team, ready to quote.

00:01:16.950 --> 00:01:23.750
We set Amphora up around your products, your packs and your rules.

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:30.950
Here, olives and fruit. For you, gherkins, tuna, olive oil or anything you pack.

00:01:31.350 --> 00:01:39.750
Amphora. Private label requests in minutes, not weeks. Book a demo.
